[[0,567377,0,25,3,22,"2015-10-06T13:04:59","goatboy","",[],"<p>The link should be to the voat page or comment section, not the external link in question.</p>","Next to the block subverse button, add an email link button, so we could make outside friends aware of topic or discussion.","","ideasforvoat"],[1,2725826,0,1,0,1,"2015-10-06T13:31:44","Arotaes_Forgehammer","",[],"<p>That would be pretty cool. </p>"],[1,2734100,0,0,0,0,"2015-10-07T01:58:04","ChillyHellion","[e]",[],"<p>I don't see much value in a dedicated share button. You can share to whatever network you want by <a href=\"https://veuwer.com/i/381b.png\">copying the discussion URL</a>. A dedicated button to copy the discussion URL serves little purpose when browsers have this ability already, and I'm not sure how to have a button that kicks the URL out to an email provider without including buttons for email, facebook, twitter, etc. </p>"]]
[]
[[0,567379,0,2,1,1,"2015-10-06T13:05:19","FightingFatForever","",[],"<p>What are some of the best left, right, lib and tea party echo chambers on the internet? With comments, discussion, articles and forums filled only with their side and no one else</p>","Echo Chambers on the Internet","","politics"],[1,2725657,0,4,0,4,"2015-10-06T13:06:55","theoldguy","",[],"<p>Pretty much any Reddit sub.</p>"],[1,2726387,0,0,0,0,"2015-10-06T14:51:05","BoiseNTheHood","",[],"<p>Liberal: 90% of the Internet</p>"],[1,2726412,0,1,0,1,"2015-10-06T14:54:13","Charlie_Prime","[e]",[],"<p><a href=\"http://democraticunderground.com\">http://democraticunderground.com</a> They will ban you for the slightest disagreement with the official narrative. Hugbox central.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.gopusa.com/forum/\">http://www.gopusa.com/forum/</a> I got banned there for promoting Ron Paul in 2007 because Paul was &quot;insane, dangerous, and senile&quot;.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://board.freedomainradio.com\">https://board.freedomainradio.com</a> for pure viciousness by the Gold Members who wait in the rafters like vultures to dive upon any newbie. </p>"]]
