[[0,567397,0,12,1,11,"2015-10-06T13:23:03","Sire","",[],"","How do you break your bad habits?","","AskVoat"],[1,2726177,0,2,0,2,"2015-10-06T14:22:37","NapoleonComplex","",[],"<p>Biting my nails: I keep a nail clipper/file in my car as well as in my bathroom. I was able to stop myself from biting my nails out of nerves by chewing gum so now I only bite them when they're long. Having clippers near me at all times makes this an easy fix</p>"],[1,2726249,0,3,0,3,"2015-10-06T14:32:56","MetalAegis","[e]",[],"<p>Smoking; by switching to vaping, some people might consider vaping a bad habit, compared to smoking its a substantial improvement. And like so many bad habit replacements you'll find the easiest fix is replacing one vice with another.</p>"],[2,2726672,2726249,1,0,1,"2015-10-06T15:22:29","Sire","",[],"<p>Good on you. Starting a different habit can break your smoking circle and get you on the path to quitting alltogether. Keep consciously at it!</p>"],[3,2728658,2726672,0,0,0,"2015-10-06T18:24:23","MetalAegis","",[],"<p>I'm afraid I won't be quitting vaping any time soon I enjoy it and fell into that cloud chasing catagory, building custom RDA's trying to make 15 foot clouds. It's turned into a hobby.</p>"],[4,2728674,2728658,0,0,0,"2015-10-06T18:25:44","Sire","",[],"<p>😳 I had no idea that's a thing. Picture please. </p>"],[5,2730234,2728674,0,0,0,"2015-10-06T20:34:43","MetalAegis","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/3B7Ws8tuEaQ\">https://youtu.be/3B7Ws8tuEaQ</a></p>"],[1,2726394,0,9,0,9,"2015-10-06T14:52:07","moshi","",[],"<p>In general? Sheer willpower. I don't see any way around it, you gotta face it head-on and make yourself do what's right.</p>"],[2,2726540,2726394,2,0,2,"2015-10-06T15:07:51","Sire","",[],"<p>Absolutely true, I'm still finding new ways to motivate/create discipline for myself. A long list of tricks def helps me stay on course. </p>"],[3,2726587,2726540,2,0,2,"2015-10-06T15:13:57","moshi","",[],"<p>Very good! Yeah, self discipline is important. :)</p>"],[4,2726600,2726587,1,0,1,"2015-10-06T15:15:31","Sire","",[],"<p>Motivation gets you rolling, discipline gets you uphill. </p>"],[5,2726630,2726600,1,0,1,"2015-10-06T15:18:52","moshi","",[],"<p>Oooh, that's good. I want this on a poster in my room!</p>"],[1,2726410,0,1,0,1,"2015-10-06T14:54:10","JohnQCitizen","",[],"<p>Get real tired. Like don't sleep for 48 hours whilst doing long hikes. By the end, even if I wanted a smoke, or a gaming session, I'm too tired to. It breaks the cycle enough that I don't fall back in easily.</p>"],[2,2726518,2726410,0,0,0,"2015-10-06T15:05:30","Sire","",[],"<p>Really? That sounds like a last resort. Doesn't anything else help you sustainably?</p>"],[3,2726912,2726518,1,0,1,"2015-10-06T15:46:52","JohnQCitizen","",[],"<p>Well, do what the others said first. My method is a last resort. I have only used it twice, but damn when I do, it works.</p>"],[1,2730744,0,0,0,0,"2015-10-06T21:20:55","Bastou","",[],"<p>By creating even worst ones, of course! ;-)</p>"]]
